    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33952" root="فص" body-key="f">
    
      R. Q. 1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَصْفَصَ</span></b>  <i>He told a narrative,</i> or <i>story,
truly;</i> (IAar, K, TA;) as though from its <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَصّ</span>,
[q. v.,] and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كُنْه</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And [the inf. n.]
signifies The <i>being hasty</i> in speech, (Ibn-'Abbád,
'O, K,) <i>and quick</i> therein. (Ibn-'Abbád, O.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2- 
Also <i>He fed</i> a beast, or horse or the like, <i>with</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِصْفِصَة</span> [q. v.]. (M.)

